# BV-A: CPU DVFS gated off (PLAN-dvfs-thermal-fp2.md §6, CP1 control).
# Identical tree and config otherwise; CPUs stay at the bootloader-set
# frequency, no HFPLL reprogramming, no krait mux switching, no rail scaling.
# This matches the shape postmarketOS ships for every msm8974 device
# (pmaports config-postmarketos-qcom-msm8974.armv7).
# Thermal monitoring stays enabled (tsens feeds telemetry; passive trips
# cannot actuate without a cpufreq cooling device; critical trip shutdown
# remains as safety backstop).
# CONFIG_QCOM_HFPLL is not set
# CONFIG_KRAITCC is not set
# CONFIG_ARM_QCOM_CPUFREQ_NVMEM is not set
